{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/bff550b288e78b977133a83263e9f5b0.poster.avif?t=1766131927\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/bff550b288e78b977133a83263e9f5b0.webm?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/bff550b288e78b977133a83263e9f5b0.mp4?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Dominion</strong> is a grim and harrowing tale of a World War I soldier trapped between life and death. After losing his family on the battlefield, he dies\u2014yet does not realize it. His soul now roams a distorted realm, searching for his daughter in the bleak night of the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classics of the genre, the game is crafted with a deep love for gothic aesthetics by a small team of five developers. Their vision draws from legendary titles such as <i>Dark Souls</i>, <i>Diablo II</i>, and <i>Demon\u2019s Souls</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/506f3ce1642f84d8f5ff950ccde1ffb3.poster.avif?t=1766131927\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/506f3ce1642f84d8f5ff950ccde1ffb3.webm?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/506f3ce1642f84d8f5ff950ccde1ffb3.mp4?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Unique Storyline:</strong> The game combines a dark gothic atmosphere with elements of psychological horror, gradually revealing the bitter truth about the player\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Descent into Madness:</strong> You will be haunted by nightmarish visions and the ghost of the one you lost. She leads you through the darkness \u2014 but can you trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Hardcore Combat:</strong> Brutal battles in the spirit of <i>Dark Souls</i> and <i>Demon\u2019s Souls</i>, featuring bosses that embody the fears and guilt of the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Exploration of a Mysterious World:</strong> Discover four vast locations filled with secrets, lore, and terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Next-Gen Graphics:</strong> A gothic world crafted with an astonishing level of detail and photorealism, immersing the player in an atmosphere of despair and melancholy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/770175e0dc0a0fe66e31369916118e92.poster.avif?t=1766131927\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/770175e0dc0a0fe66e31369916118e92.webm?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/770175e0dc0a0fe66e31369916118e92.mp4?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/8b7aff305ba51d58884dc314a8d0e1e0.poster.avif?t=1766131927\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/8b7aff305ba51d58884dc314a8d0e1e0.webm?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/8b7aff305ba51d58884dc314a8d0e1e0.mp4?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/e27adb7c30650ff069827db129ff6dcb.poster.avif?t=1766131927\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/e27adb7c30650ff069827db129ff6dcb.webm?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/e27adb7c30650ff069827db129ff6dcb.mp4?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>4 Expansive Acts</strong><br>Each act is a twisted, deadly labyrinth of ruined cities, temples, and dungeons. Explore, survive, uncover secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Dozens of Unique Armor Sets</strong><br>Collect and combine light, medium, and heavy armors. Each set grants unique bonuses and influences your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Varied Weaponry</strong><br>Swords, spears, axes, blades, crossbows, artifacts, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Dark Magic and Cursed Powers</strong><br>Master devastating spells: fire, blood, lightning, illusions. Magic is powerful \u2014 but every spell comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>RPG System</strong><br>Every stat point is a choice.<br>Make the wrong one \u2014 and pay with your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Merciless Enemies and Bosses</strong><br>Around 100 distinct types of monsters, traps, and terrifying bosses await. Each has its own rhythm, style, and weakness. Learn, adapt \u2014 or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will walk through hell \u2014 and become a shadow that makes even the darkness tremble.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/0c7e930909e7fa6c5a4011ffff8fb62b.poster.avif?t=1766131927\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/0c7e930909e7fa6c5a4011ffff8fb62b.webm?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/0c7e930909e7fa6c5a4011ffff8fb62b.mp4?t=1766131927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237640?t=1766131927","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766131927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/ff8f91bab0884577e21599bc86dcf54125b2f9a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766131927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/ff8f91bab0884577e21599bc86dcf54125b2f9a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766131927","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of cruelty and violence, chopping off limbs, meat, corpses, blood. The game is not recommended for particularly sensitive people."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item